{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/ES_Banner.jpg?t=1746719787\" /><strong>EXPERIENCE A BREATHTAKING TECHNO-FANTASY WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNRAVEL AN EPIC STORY OF POST HUMAN FUTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Human Epoch Comes To An End</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In utmost secrecy, the mysterious <strong>CHOIR</strong> has constructed <strong>ENIGMA</strong>, a vast supercomputer hosting an autonomous network beyond Earth's control.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>As government forces mobilize to seize the station, ENIGMA falls <strong>SILENT</strong>. No signals penetrate its hull, leaving humanity to wonder what\u00a0 forces stir within.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Now, a lone humanoid AI named <strong>WEYL</strong> awakens aboard the dormant station. Armed with ancient technology that bridges the digital and <strong>DIVINE</strong>, WEYL must uncover the truth behind ENIGMA's silence and choose between <strong>HUMANITY'S SALVATION</strong> or its <strong>TRANSCENDENCE</strong>...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/EnigmaStation_AerialBulletHell.gif?t=1746719787\" /><strong>TAKE FLIGHT IN INTENSE AERIAL BATTLES.</strong> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/EnigmaStation_Ritual.gif?t=1746719787\" /><strong>SOLVE ENVIRONMENTAL PUZZLES, MANIPULATE FUTURISTIC TECH DEVICES AND DECODE CRYPTIC CLUES.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/EnigmaStation_Altar.gif?t=1746719787\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>IMMERSE YOURSEL